    "alert_id": "P005_TDF_MONITORING_GAP_002",
    "title": "Renal function monitoring overdue on TDF",
    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR monitoring for patients on a TDF-based backbone. This patient's last documented creatinine was in 2023 (1.2 mg/dL), meaning renal function was not reassessed in 2024 or 2025 despite continuing TDF. The current value of 1.4 mg/dL with eGFR 52 confirms significant decline went undetected between visits. No assessment or plan was written at today's encounter, and no renal monitoring orders are documented.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Establish scheduled serum creatinine and eGFR monitoring at guideline-recommended intervals for patients on TDF, and document renal assessment at today's visit.",
